#: plugins/power/csd-power-manager.c:1653
msgid "Battery is critically low"
msgstr "Acculading is kritiek laag"

#: plugins/power/csd-power-manager.c:1562
msgid ""
"The battery is below the critical level and this computer will <b>power-"
"off</b> when the battery becomes completely empty."
msgstr ""
"De acculading is onder het kritieke niveau en deze computer zal "
"<b>uitvallen</b> zodra de accu volledig leeg is."

#: plugins/power/csd-power-manager.c:1568
msgid ""
"The battery is below the critical level and this computer is about to "
"suspend.\n"
"<b>NOTE:</b> A small amount of power is required to keep your computer in a "
"suspended state."
msgstr ""
"De acculading is onder het kritieke niveau en deze computer zal zo in "
"pauzestand gaan.\n"
"<b>LET OP:</b> ook in pauzestand verbruikt de computer een kleine "
"hoeveelheid stroom."

#: plugins/power/csd-power-manager.c:1575
msgid ""
"The battery is below the critical level and this computer is about to "
"hibernate."
msgstr ""
"De acculading is onder het kritieke niveau. Deze computer zal zo in "
"slaapstand gaan."

#: plugins/power/csd-power-manager.c:1580
msgid ""
"The battery is below the critical level and this computer is about to "
"shutdown."
msgstr ""
"De acculading is onder het kritieke niveau. Deze computer zal zo worden "
"afgesloten."

#: plugins/power/csd-power-manager.c:1598
msgid ""
"UPS is below the critical level and this computer will <b>power-off</b> when "
"the UPS becomes completely empty."
msgstr ""
"De lading van de UPS is onder het kritieke niveau. De computer zal "
"<b>uitvallen</b> zodra de UPS volledig leeg is."

#: plugins/power/csd-power-manager.c:1604
msgid ""
"UPS is below the critical level and this computer is about to hibernate."
msgstr ""
"De lading van de UPS is onder het kritieke niveau. De computer zal zo in "
"slaapstand gaan."

#: plugins/power/csd-power-manager.c:1609
msgid ""
"UPS is below the critical level and this computer is about to shutdown."
msgstr ""
"De lading van de UPS is onder het kritieke niveau. De computer zal zo "
"uitgeschakeld worden."

